ITH/WMON is router venue #121, so any Candor swap can route through it\n• WRAITH Wallet: price and chart read straight from the pool\n\n👻 THE WRAITH STACK\n• WRAITH Wallet: 2,400+ networks, native Monero and shielded Zcash in the browser, an on-device AI agent, native Perpl perps, passkeys. Web + Android.\n• Confidential Balances: hidden balances and amounts on Monad, sealed with ML-KEM-1024 and proven with a hash-based STARK. 0 elliptic curves, no trusted setup, no admin key. Not a mixer.\n• Grimoire: a quantum-resistant second key your wallet does not hold. The seed alone can neither read nor move the funds.\n• Eidolon: a private payment you hand over as a key: on paper, as a QR, in a message.\n• Reliquary: a quantum-resistant vault for NFTs you already own. No approvals, ever.\n• WRAITH Mail: post-quantum messages (ML-KEM-1024 + ML-DSA-87) with no message server. The chain is the pipe. Beta.\n• WRAITH Secure OS: boots from Monad calldata, verified every boot, runs in RAM, writes 0 bytes to the host.\n• WRAITHGRID: a decentralized data center. Proof-of-compute, bonded and slashable providers, settled on Monad.\n• Candor: spoof-proof routing. Every venue is probed inside your transaction, so the quote is the fill.\n• Monspad: the Monad launchpad with a floor that rises. One Uniswap v4 hook, no migration, bundle protection.\n• DropClaw EVMFS: permanent file storage in Monad calldata. One-time fee, AES-256-GCM + ML-KEM-768 encryption, MonadVault app.\n\n📚 TECHNICAL DOSSIERS\nEvery product above has its own technical dossier: contracts, specs and how it is tested. The Website button opens the hub with all of them. Docs opens the $WRAITH dossier.\n\n📄 CA (Monad): 0x7E8BDf7D262a6e4ff9302Af49F2CdB022B587777\nSupply: 1,000,000,000 · 18 decimals\nAlways check the CA. Anything else calling itself $WRAITH is not it.\n\nBuybacks are a mechanism, not a promise about price. Nothing here is investment advice.","links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://dagentx.com"},{"label":"Do